---
import { sitePath, site } from "../data";
import capture from "../../static/media/desktop/record.json";
---

<section class="desktop-showcase" id="desktop" aria-labelledby="desktop-title">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / A WORKSPACE THAT BUILDS</p>
      <span class="section-note">JE DESKTOP / REAL TASK CAPTURE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="section-intro">
      <h2 id="desktop-title">把任务，<br /><span class="muted">变成可运行的产出。</span></h2>
      <p>一个想法，一份 HTML，一个震撼的 3D 成品。<br />看 JE 从零创作「赛博朋克 3D 霓虹极速公路」，再打开页面体验极速狂飙。</p>
    </div>

    <figure class="desktop-film">
      <div class="film-topline"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> CYBERPUNK SYNTHWAVE / REAL SESSION</span><span>Electron · JE Engine · DeepSeek</span></div>
      <video
        id="desktop-video"
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="none"
        poster={sitePath("/media/desktop/poster.jpg")}
        width="1480"
        height="960"
        aria-label="JE Desktop 真实任务录像：从零生成赛博朋克 3D 霓虹公路，并展示 240 MPH 实机交互"
        aria-describedby="desktop-video-caption"
      >
        <source src={sitePath("/media/desktop/task-demo.mp4")} type="video/mp4" />
        <track kind="captions" src={sitePath("/media/desktop/captions.vtt")} srclang="zh" label="中文操作说明" default />
        你的浏览器不支持视频。<a href={sitePath("/media/desktop/task-demo.mp4")}>下载任务录像</a>。
      </video>
      <figcaption id="desktop-video-caption">
        <span>真实桌面录屏 · {capture.playback_note} · 无配音</span>
        <a href={sitePath("/media/desktop/task-demo.mp4")} download>下载视频 ↗</a>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="film-chapters" aria-label="跳转到视频章节">
      {capture.chapters.map((chapter, index) => (
        <button type="button" data-film-seek={chapter.time} aria-controls="desktop-video">
          <small>0{index + 1}</small><span>{chapter.label}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p id="film-status" class="film-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

    <div class="desktop-outcomes">
      <article><span class="outcome-number">01</span><h3>从文字，到 3D 视界</h3><p>模型实际编写原生 Canvas 数学透视投影算法。从星空落日到发光霓虹赛道，单文件零依赖离线运行。</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath("/media/desktop/output/synthwave.html")} download>下载 JE 生成的 HTML ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="outcome-number">02</span><h3>240 MPH 极速狂飙</h3><p>超跑转向侧倾、尾灯流光拖影与氮气爆发。Web Audio 原生合成引擎轰鸣与琶音，并在真实节点完成静态校验。</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath("/media/desktop/record.json")}>查看录制与验收记录 ↗</a></article>
      <article><span class="outcome-number">03</span><h3>交付，即可试驾</h3><p>下方直接运行生成页面。支持键盘 WASD/方向键变道、空格氮气喷射与 C 键切换复古 CRT 扫描线滤镜。</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath("/media/desktop/output/synthwave.html")} target="_blank" rel="noopener">全屏试驾极速狂飙 ↗</a></article>
    </div>
    <figure class="generated-preview">
      <figcaption><span>LIVE OUTPUT / JE 生成的原生 3D 应用</span><a href={sitePath("/media/desktop/output/synthwave.html")} target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开成品 ↗</a></figcaption>
      <iframe src={sitePath("/media/desktop/output/synthwave.html")} title="交互体验：JE 生成的赛博朋克 3D 霓虹极速公路" loading="lazy" sandbox="allow-scripts"></iframe>
    </figure>
    <div class="desktop-details"><p>文件树与 Monaco 编辑器 · 持久化会话 · Skills / Prompts / Tools · 可检查的执行轨迹</p><a class="text-link" href={`${site.githubUrl}/tree/main/desktop`}>桌面端源码与运行说明 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={sitePath("/media/desktop/record.json")}>本次任务记录 ↗</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const video = document.querySelector<HTMLVideoElement>("#desktop-video");
  const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#film-status");
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-film-seek]").forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
      if (!video) return;
      const time = Number(button.dataset.filmSeek);
      if (!Number.isFinite(time)) return;
      try {
        if (video.readyState < 1) {
          video.preload = "metadata";
          video.load();
          await new Promise<void>((resolve, reject) => {
            const done = () => { cleanup(); resolve(); };
            const failed = () => { cleanup(); reject(new Error("视频暂时无法加载")); };
            const timeout = window.setTimeout(failed, 15000);
            const cleanup = () => {
              window.clearTimeout(timeout);
              video.removeEventListener("loadedmetadata", done);
              video.removeEventListener("error", failed);
            };
            video.addEventListener("loadedmetadata", done, { once: true });
            video.addEventListener("error", failed, { once: true });
          });
        }
        video.currentTime = Math.min(time, video.duration);
        await video.play();
        if (status) status.textContent = "";
      } catch {
        if (status) status.textContent = "请点击播放器继续播放，或下载视频查看。";
      }
    });
  });
</script>
